Name: Autism prediction and analysis

Aim: predicting the possiblity of causing autism using the dataset downloaded from kaggle

tools and libraries:
pandas,numpy, matplotlib, seaborn and scikit-learn

Process:
 Step 1: Data Loading
 Step 2: Initial Data Exploration
 Step 3: Data Preprocessing
 Step 4: Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
    Class Distribution (Pie Chart)
    Identify Numeric and Categorical Columns
    Count Plots for Numerical Features
    Count Plots for Categorical Features
    Country-wise Comparison
    Distribution and Boxplots for Decimal Features
 Step 5: Correlation Heatmap
 Step 6: Data Modeling (Supervised Learning)
 Step 7: Unsupervised Learning – KMeans Clustering by Country


